# Line endings for everything git already tracks are left exactly as they are on
# purpose: a blanket `text=auto` here would renormalize the whole tree in one
# commit. What has to be pinned down is the set of files a line-ending filter
# would silently corrupt, and the two that break if they are wrong on CI.

*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mov binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.aar binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.glb binary
*.pdf binary
*.dat binary
